format-version: 1.2
ontology: http://example.org/o
owl-axioms: Prefix(owl:=<http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>)\nPrefix(rdf:=<http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>)\nPrefix(xml:=<http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace>)\nPrefix(xsd:=<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>)\nPrefix(rdfs:=<http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>)\n\n\nOntology(\nDeclaration(Class(<http://example.org/o#A>))\nDeclaration(Class(<http://example.org/o#B>))\nDeclaration(DataProperty(<http://example.org/o#d>))\nDeclaration(NamedIndividual(<http://example.org/o#i>))\nDeclaration(NamedIndividual(<http://example.org/o#j>))\n\n\n\n\nDLSafeRule(Body(DataPropertyAtom(<http://example.org/o#d> <http://example.org/o#i> Variable(<http://example.org/o#y>)) ClassAtom(<http://example.org/o#A> Variable(<http://example.org/o#x>)))Head(ClassAtom(<http://example.org/o#B> Variable(<http://example.org/o#x>))))\nDLSafeRule(Body(DataPropertyAtom(<http://example.org/o#d> Variable(<http://example.org/o#x>) \"w\") DataPropertyAtom(<http://example.org/o#d> <http://example.org/o#i> \"v\"))Head(DataPropertyAtom(<http://example.org/o#d> <http://example.org/o#j> Variable(<http://example.org/o#x>))))\n)

